ategory":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 1.34"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":849.53,"default_fair_val":849.53,"premium_pct":-83.9,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":8.3,"pe_forward":7.3,"pb_trailing":0.9,"pb_forward":0.8,"div_yield":3.93,"ps_ratio":1.3,"fcf_to_ev":17.26,"fcf_to_mcap":18.88,"liab_to_assets":40.8,"cash_to_assets":5.8,"current_ratio":1.34,"roe":10.9,"roa":6.4,"moat":{"ticker":"CHRD","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"CHRD 屬於油氣勘探與生產行業，這是一個高度商品化的市場，產品缺乏差異化，品牌效應微弱。公司無法顯著影響市場價格，其定價能力受限於全球原油及天然氣的供需關係和市場行情。雖然公司追求營運效率，但這並非品牌定價力的體現。與消費品或軟體公司相比，其品牌價值對定價的影響力幾乎為零，因此在此維度上得分較低。","comment_en":"CHRD operates in the oil and gas exploration and production industry, a highly commoditized market where products lack differentiation and brand effect is minimal. The company cannot significantly influence market prices, and its pricing power is constrained by global crude oil and natural gas supply-demand dynamics and market conditions. While the company pursues operational efficiency, this does not translate to brand pricing power. Compared to consumer goods or software companies, the impact of its brand value on pricing is almost nil, hence the low score in this dimension."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"油氣勘探與生產行業的進入壁壘主要來自於資本密集度、技術門檻以及對特定區域的開採權。CHRD 的業務模式不依賴於專利技術或獨特的監管許可來建立競爭優勢。雖然行業內存在一定的技術創新和環保法規要求，但這些並非 CHRD 獨有的、可持續的專利或特許權，無法構成顯著的經濟護城河。其核心競爭力更多體現在對現有資源的有效開發和成本控制上。","comment_en":"Barriers to entry in the oil and gas exploration and production industry primarily stem from capital intensity, technical expertise, and exploration rights in specific regions. CHRD's business model does not rely on patented technologies or unique regulatory licenses to establish a competitive advantage. While there is technological innovation and environmental regulation within the industry, these are not unique, sustainable patents or licenses exclusive to CHRD, and thus do not form a significant economic moat. Its core competitiveness is more reflected in the efficient development of existing resources and cost control."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"CHRD 的客戶主要是大型工業用戶、煉油廠或能源交易商，這些客戶的轉換成本相對較低。雖然長期供應合約可以提供一定的穩定性，但客戶在選擇供應商時，價格、供應可靠性是主要考量因素，而非深度綁定。一旦市場出現更具吸引力的價格或供應條件，客戶轉向其他供應商的可能性是存在的。因此，CHRD 在此維度上不具備顯著的護城河。","comment_en":"CHRD's customers are primarily large industrial users, refineries, or energy traders, for whom switching costs are relatively low. While long-term supply contracts can provide some stability, price and supply reliability are the main considerations when customers choose suppliers, rather than deep lock-in. If more attractive prices or supply conditions emerge in the market, customers may switch to other suppliers. Therefore, CHRD does not possess a significant moat in this dimension."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"網絡效應通常存在於平台型業務、社交媒體或通訊服務中，即用戶越多，服務價值越大。CHRD 所處的油氣勘探與生產行業，其業務模式不具備網絡效應的特徵。產品的價值與生產商的數量或客戶的數量之間不存在正向反饋循環。公司營運的效率和產量與網絡參與者的增減無關，因此在此維度上得分為零。","comment_en":"Network effects are typically found in platform businesses, social media, or communication services, where more users lead to greater service value. The oil and gas exploration and production industry, where CHRD operates, does not exhibit characteristics of network effects in its business model. There is no positive feedback loop between the value of the product and the number of producers or customers. The efficiency and output of the company's operations are unrelated to the increase or decrease of network participants, hence the score of zero in this dimension."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"CHRD 作為一家大型油氣生產商，其規模經濟帶來了一定的成本優勢。在勘探、鑽井、生產和運輸環節，較大的營運規模有助於攤薄固定成本，並可能在採購設備、服務時獲得更優惠的價格。此外，公司在特定油氣儲區的集中開發，也能進一步提升營運效率和降低單位成本。然而，油價波動仍是影響其盈利能力的主要外部因素，規模優勢的絕對性相對有限。","comment_en":"As a large oil and gas producer, CHRD benefits from certain cost advantages due to economies of scale. In exploration, drilling, production, and transportation, a larger operational scale helps spread fixed costs and may allow for more favorable pricing when procuring equipment and services. Furthermore, concentrated development in specific oil and gas reserves can further enhance operational efficiency and reduce unit costs. However, oil price volatility remains the primary external factor affecting its profitability, and the absolute nature of its scale advantage is relatively limited."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"CHRD 在美國二疊紀盆地（Permian Basin）擁有重要的油氣資產組合。該盆地是北美最重要、產量最高的頁岩油產區之一，擁有成熟的基礎設施和相對穩定的地質條件。雖然該區域存在其他競爭者，但 CHRD 在此區域的深耕和資源儲備，使其具備一定的地理優勢。然而，油氣資源的開採權和儲量具有一定的周期性和可替代性，並非絕對的壟斷。","comment_en":"CHRD holds a significant portfolio of oil and gas assets in the Permian Basin, USA. This basin is one of North America's most important and highest-producing shale oil regions, with mature infrastructure and relatively stable geological conditions. While other competitors exist in this area, CHRD's deep involvement and resource reserves in this region provide it with a certain geographical advantage. However, the extraction rights and reserves of oil and gas resources are subject to cyclicality and substitutability, and do not represent an absolute monopoly."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"CHRD 在營運效率方面表現出色，這在其較高的 ROA（6.4%）和 F-Score（8/9）以及穩健的自由現金流（FCF TTM: $1,409.6M）中得到體現。公司似乎專注於優化生產流程、控制成本，並有效管理其資產。這種對營運效率的持續追求，使其在行業內具有競爭力，能夠在市場波動中保持相對穩定的表現。這反映了管理層在日常營運中的卓越能力。","comment_en":"CHRD demonstrates strong operational efficiency, as evidenced by its relatively high ROA (6.4%), F-Score (8/9), and robust Free Cash Flow (FCF TTM: $1,409.6M). The company appears focused on optimizing production processes, controlling costs, and effectively managing its assets. This continuous pursuit of operational efficiency makes it competitive within the industry and allows it to maintain relatively stable performance amidst market fluctuations. This reflects the management's excellent capabilities in day-to-day operations."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"CHRD 的管理層在資本配置方面展現出一定的紀律性，其較高的 ROE（10.9%）和穩健的自由現金流是積極信號。公司在維持穩定的股息支付和股票回購之間取得平衡，同時也進行必要的資本支出以維持和擴大生產。儘管如此，油氣行業的資本密集度和對未來能源轉型的考量，使得其資本配置決策面臨挑戰。整體而言，管理層的資本配置能力尚可，但仍有提升空間。","comment_en":"CHRD's management demonstrates a degree of discipline in capital allocation, with its relatively high ROE (10.9%) and solid free cash flow being positive indicators. The company balances stable dividend payments with share repurchases, while also undertaking necessary capital expenditures to maintain and expand production. Nevertheless, the capital-intensive nature of the oil and gas industry and considerations for future energy transitions present challenges for its capital allocation decisions. Overall, management's capital allocation capability is acceptable, but there is room for improvement."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"如 M3 所述，CHRD 的客戶基礎主要是工業用戶和能源交易商，這些客戶的忠誠度相對較低，轉換成本不高。雖然公司致力於提供可靠的供應和有競爭力的價格，但客戶的選擇很大程度上取決於市場價格和供應情況。缺乏獨特的產品或服務，使得客戶黏性不足，難以形成持續的客戶留存壁壘。因此，在客戶留存方面，CHRD 的護城河較為薄弱。","comment_en":"As mentioned in M3, CHRD's customer base primarily consists of industrial users and energy traders, whose loyalty is relatively low and switching costs are not high. While the company strives to provide reliable supply and competitive pricing, customer choice is largely dependent on market prices and supply availability. The lack of unique products or services results in insufficient customer stickiness, making it difficult to form a sustainable customer retention moat. Therefore, CHRD's moat in terms of customer retention is relatively weak."},"m10_durability":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"CHRD 的業務模式在短期內具有一定的可持續性，尤其是在其專注的二疊紀盆地。然而，長期來看，油氣行業面臨著來自可再生能源的競爭以及全球能源轉型的壓力。雖然短期內對化石燃料的需求依然強勁，但其長期需求的可見度受到挑戰。公司的資產（油氣儲量）是有限的，且面臨開採殆盡的風險。因此，其業務的長期持久性存在不確定性，護城河的穩固性相對一般。","comment_en":"CHRD's business model possesses a degree of sustainability in the short term, particularly within its focused Permian Basin operations. However, in the long run, the oil and gas industry faces competition from renewable energy sources and the pressure of global energy transition. While demand for fossil fuels remains strong in the short term, its long-term demand visibility is challenged. The company's assets (oil and gas reserves) are finite and face the risk of depletion. Therefore, the long-term durability of its business is uncertain, and the stability of its moat is average."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"CHRD 是一家位於美國二疊紀盆地的油氣生產商，其經濟護城河主要體現在規模帶來的成本優勢（M5）和特定區域的資源稟賦（M6）。公司在營運效率（M7）方面表現突出，能夠有效控制成本並產生穩健的自由現金流。然而，其業務高度商品化，缺乏品牌定價權（M1）、專利壁壘（M2）和客戶轉換成本（M3），網絡效應（M4）更是無從談起。雖然管理層在資本配置（M8）上尚可，但行業面臨能源轉型壓力，業務的長期持久性（M10）存在不確定性。整體而言，CHRD 屬於典型的「商品型」企業，其護城河相對有限且易受外部環境影響，屬於穩固但非罕見的壁壘。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"CHRD, an oil and gas producer in the Permian Basin, USA, derives its economic moat primarily from cost advantages stemming from scale (M5) and its resource endowment in a specific region (M6). The company excels in operational efficiency (M7), effectively controlling costs and generating robust free cash flow. However, its business is highly commoditized, lacking brand pricing power (M1), patent barriers (M2), and customer switching costs (M3), with no network effects (M4) whatsoever. While management's capital allocation (M8) is adequate, the industry faces energy transition pressures, casting uncertainty on the long-term durability (M10) of its business. Overall, CHRD is a typical 'commodity-like' business with a limited and externally influenced moat, representing a solid but not rare barrier.","evidenceHash":"8566f62fe9a76547e7fea5659af1bae7768496cd4839829712f1ed65b089634d","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null,"evidenceHash":"8566f62fe9a76547e7fea5659af1bae7768496cd4839829712f1ed65b089634d","currentEvidenceHash":"8566f62fe9a76547e7fea5659af1bae7768496cd4839829712f1ed65b089634d"},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-07T13:51:10.323Z","evidenceHash":"d3caa02967015c0f2a6d3528a7835de08847b246419c51d28259b44a083088d9"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"windowDressing","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-07T13:51:10.323Z","evidenceHash":"d3caa02967015c0f2a6d3528a7835de08847b246419c51d28259b44a083088d9"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/CHRD.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/CHRD.png","website":"https://www.chordenergy.com","ceo":"Michael Lou","full_time_employees":"676","description":"As an independent enterprise, Chord Energy Corporation specializes in the exploration and production of hydrocarbon resources. Its core activities include the sourcing, development, and recovery of crude oil, natural gas, and natural gas liquids, with all operations concentrated within the Williston Basin. This company was established in 2007 and bases its operations from its headquarters in Houston, Texas.","description_en":"As an independent enterprise, Chord Energy Corporation specializes in the exploration and production of hydrocarbon resources. Its core activities include the sourcing, development, and recovery of crude oil, natural gas, and natural gas liquids, with all operations concentrated within the Williston Basin. This company was established in 2007 and bases its operations from its headquarters in Houston, Texas.","description_zh":"**Chord Energy Corporation (CHRD) 業務營運簡述**\n\nChord Energy Corporation (CHRD) 是一家獨立的油氣探勘與生產企業，專注於碳氫化合物資源的開發與生產。其核心業務涵蓋原油、天然氣及天然氣凝液（NGLs）的勘探、開發與開採。\n\n公司所有營運活動均集中於美國的威利斯頓盆地（Williston Basin），此區域為其關鍵的生產基地。CHRD 透過先進的鑽探與生產技術，有效率地從該盆地豐富的儲層中提取油氣資源。其營運模式著重於優化資產組合，並透過精準的資本配置來提升生產效率與成本效益。\n\nCHRD 成立於 2007 年，總部位於德州休士頓。公司致力於成為威利斯頓盆地領先的油氣生產商，透過穩健的營運策略與對技術的持續投入，為股東創造長期價值。","address":"1001 Fannin Street","city":"Houston","state":"TX","zip":"77002","country":"US","phone":"281 404 9500","full_address":"1001 Fannin Street, Houston, TX 77002, US","range_52w":"86.28-159.96","year_high":159.96,"year_low":86.28,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":86.28,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-11-02","name":"Lou Michael H","title":"officer: President and CEO","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":6543,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-02","name":"McKinney Samantha","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":6250,"price":149.74,"total_val":0.94},{"date":"2026-09-02","name":"McKinney Samantha","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":3500,"price":150.3,"total_val":0.53},{"date":"2026-08-24","name":"Brown Daniel E","title":"director, officer: President and CEO","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":6120,"price":150.65,"total_val":0.92},{"date":"2026-08-24","name":"Brown Daniel E","title":"director, officer: President and CEO","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":4102,"price":151.66,"total_val":0.62},{"date":"2026-08-24","name":"Brown Daniel E","title":"director, officer: President and CEO","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":2826,"price":152.34,"total_val":0.43},{"date":"2026-08-24","name":"Brown Daniel E","title":"director, officer: President and CEO","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":656,"price":150.12,"total_val":0.1},{"date":"2026-08-12","name":"McKinney Samantha","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":1100,"price":135.56,"total_val":0.15},{"date":"2026-08-12","nam